i
Split ""
Convert to Integers
Part "1":
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> concat(x, list(item(x, 0)))
    Window 2
    Map Each
        Using: (x) -> if item(x, 0) = item(x, 1) then item(x, 0) else 0
    Sum
    stdout
Part "2":
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> concat(x, x)
    Window
        Size: (x) -> (length(x) / 4) + 1
    Map Each
        Using: (x) -> if first(x) = last(x) then first(x) else 0
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> take(x, floor(tofloat(length(x)) / 1.5))
    Sum
    stdout
